  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of peaceful coexistence between the border dioceses of Cyangugu, Bubanza and Bukavu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main activities will be focused on strengthening capacities for promoting values of cohabitation, awareness and advocacy in cohesion among the population.
Activities envisaged are the folowed: 
- Workshops on the theme of peace, peaceful cohabitation and positive effects of the dynamics of social cohesion 
- Meetings of tolerance and mutual understanding with young people and women
- Days&apos; travel  integrating local structures involved in the project 
- Creation and management of specific groups composed of peaceful cohabitation witnesses in the parishes of the Diocese of Cyangugu.</narrative>
  </description>
